<</BS<</W 0>>/CA 1/Contents(The program named Guidance_Bob.exe is the name of one of the byproducts of Marcelas consciences successive branchingsm, which after dissociating of its status of reflection of the scientists mind, developed one of its own, and started to operate in\
dependently, with the goal of expanding its knowledge and helping her journey. Currently residing in one of the computers in the room where the original conscience currently resides, Guidance_Bob.exe can be executed mainly in ManicSys Tunnels operating s\
ystems and it has open source versions for Doorix devices. It appears to be 714 MB in size, and when interacting with its app icon, it opens in a custom shell, similarly to an 80s personal computer, where the user is faced with an ASCII art of its name, a\
nd a prompt to type. It has no known limits for characters or lines.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Arial 10 Tf)/DS(font: Arial,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240917220429-03'00')/NM(d7acb930cdb148c288da8a71ac95f1c3)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\
l;font-family:Arial;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="text-align:justify">The program named &#8220;Guidance_Bob.exe&#8221; is the name of one of the byproducts of Marcela&#8217;s consciences&#8217; successive branchingsm, which after dissocia\
ting of its status of &#8220;reflection&#8221; of the scientist&#8217;s mind, developed one of its own, and started to operate independently, with the goal of expanding its knowledge and helping her journey. Currently residing in one of the computers in t\
he room where the original conscience currently resides, Guidance_Bob.exe can be executed mainly in ManicSys&#8217; Tunnels operating systems and it has open source versions for Doorix devices. It appears to be 714 MB in size, and when interacting with it\
s app icon, it opens in a custom shell, similarly to an 80s personal computer, where the user is faced with an ASCII art of its name, and a prompt to type. It has no known limits for characters or lines.</span></p></body>)/Rect[45.3301 100.864 571.302 206.874]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>
